# The web app build only needs: package.json/lock, index.html, vite/tailwind/
# postcss configs, app/client/, public/ (committed data+images+models),
# app/server/. Everything else - the Blender pipeline (blender/, output/),
# docs, tests, node_modules, dev logs - stays out of the image entirely.
